{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:AxB_ArtXVII_13","page_type":"section"},"citation":"AxB Art. XVII § 13","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/AxB_ArtXVII_13","content_hash":"7d12f83649a81a1eeaa1fb109798add4a2092248c6976b2d88eca4d28532fa5b","heading":"Section 13. [POINT OF CONTACT AND NOTICES.]","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xvii-13:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/AxB_ArtXVII_13","text":"IdeaTek shall at all times maintain with the City a local point of contact who shall be available at all times to act on behalf of IdeaTek in the event of an emergency.\nAll other notices between the parties shall be in writing and shall be made by personal delivery or by depositing such notice in the U.S. Mail, Certified Mail, return receipt requested. Any notice served by U.S. Mail or Certified Mail, return receipt requested, shall be deemed delivered five (5) calendar days after the date of such deposit in the U.S. Mail unless otherwise provided. “Business day” for purposes of this section shall mean Monday through Friday, City and/or IdeaTek observed holidays excepted.\nThe City: | IdeaTek:\nCity Clerk Attn: Brenda Younger 215 SE 7th St. Topeka, KS 66603 cclerk@topeka.org | IdeaTek Telcom Attn: Contract Notifications P.O. Box 407 Buhler, KS 67522 Daniel@ideatek.com\nThe City:\nIdeaTek:\nCity Clerk\nAttn: Brenda Younger\n215 SE 7th St.\nTopeka, KS 66603\ncclerk@topeka.org\nIdeaTek Telcom\nAttn: Contract Notifications\nP.O. Box 407\nBuhler, KS 67522\nDaniel@ideatek.com\nor to replacement addresses that may be later designated in writing.\n(Ord. 20581 § 13, 8-12-25.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"11fc0bca-add3-5088-b3da-f6b19c963a96"},{"attributes":{"block